{
  "_comment": [
    "09-14 — representative payloads for the accepted v1.37.24 cyclic/PRN contract.",
    "Synthetic throughout: invented ids, invented names, no health value, no owner",
    "id, no token, no host, no captured response body.",
    "",
    "`cyclicMedication` and `prnMedication` carry the published READ shape",
    "(MedicationListEntry + MedicationScheduleOutput at tag v1.37.24, commit",
    "e00d013459d88bb8be4b197138cf72da489c1645). Every key present on a schedule",
    "row is declared by MedicationScheduleOutput, which is additionalProperties:",
    "false — so a key iOS expects that is missing here is missing on the wire too.",
    "",
    "`legacyCachedSchedule` and `legacyOutboxCreate` are the PRE-FIX on-device",
    "shapes: a MedicationSchedule blob written into the SWR cache by a build that",
    "still had an anchor on Cadence.cyclic, and a MedicationCreate body queued in",
    "the outbox by a build that still emitted cycleWeeksOn / cycleWeeksOff /",
    "cycleAnchor and a schedule-level asNeeded. They exist so the update path is",
    "tested rather than assumed."
  ],
